### Mechanic: Swing Impulse & Launch
INTENT: Read friction and spring tension modifiers, apply input impulse to the mallet, and launch the puck with velocity when the lever threshold is hit.
PSEUDO:
  local friction = AttractionConstants.modifiers.friction
  local spring_tension = AttractionConstants.modifiers.spring_tension
  if IsActionDown("fire") then
    ApplyImpulse(mallet, 0, -10 * spring_tension, 0)
  end
  if IsSensorTriggered(bell) then
    local pos = GetPosition(puck)
    SetLinearVelocity(puck, 0, pos.y + 5, 0)
  end
  if IsSensorTriggered(puck) then
    SetFriction(puck, friction)
  end
API:
  ApplyImpulse(handle, ix, iy, iz)
  SetLinearVelocity(handle, vx, vy, vz)
  SetFriction(handle, v)
